ved installation, maintenance and testing program for fire alarm systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0353":{"code":"K-0353","title":"Inspect, test, and maintain automatic sprinkler systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0363":{"code":"K-0363","title":"Install corridor and hallway doors that block smoke.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0686":{"code":"F-0686","title":"Provide appropriate pressure ulcer care and prevent new ulcers from developing.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0689":{"code":"F-0689","title":"Ensure that a nursing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0882":{"code":"F-0882","title":"Designate a qualified infection preventionist to be responsible for the infection prevent and control program in the nursing home.","category":"Infection Control Deficiencies","concept":"infection_prevention","concept_label":"Infection prevention"},"cms-f0607":{"code":"F-0607","title":"Develop and implement policies and procedures to prevent abuse, neglect, and theft.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0580":{"code":"F-0580","title":"Immediately tell the resident, the resident's doctor, and a family member of situations (injury/decline/room, etc.)  that affect the resident.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0684":{"code":"F-0684","title":"